            <div xml:id="d775">

                <pb facs="0957" n="833" xml:id="pg833"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00/2302: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-01-23T17:00:00-04:40"><hi rendition="#italic">January 23,
                                1921—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received January 24—2:05
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>4. The four members of former Advisory Council and President of the Supreme Court
                    have signified their willingness to accept membership on the Commission. …</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
